oints (k=0.5, k=0.9) for OpenVLA, X-VLA, SmolVLA on each suite. Validates cross-suite generalization of connector-determined compressibility.\"\n171\t    priority: P0\n172\t    status: in_progress\n173\t    exp_ids: []\n174\t\n175\t  - plan_id: c6_libero_suite_vtr\n176\t    claim: C4\n177\t    description: \"VTR compression validation on LIBERO Spatial/Goal/Long. SmolVLA VTR M=32 on each suite to confirm re-encoding works across task distributions.\"\n178\t    priority: P1\n179\t    status: planned\n180\t    exp_ids: []\n181\t\n182\t  - plan_id: c7_libero_plus_robustness\n183\t    claim: C1,C3\n184\t    description: \"ABANDONED (D119): LIBERO-Plus L1 camera SR=3.3% floor effect — no room for pruning analysis. Finding noted in discussion as VLA brittleness evidence.\"\n185\t    priority: deprioritized\n186\t    status: abandoned\n187\t    exp_ids: []\n188\t\n189\t  - plan_id: c1_pi05_immune_confirmation\n190\t    claim: C1\n191\t    description: \"π0.5 (4B, PaliGemma linear proj) — 2nd immune-class data point. Offline CV/entropy analysis + LIBERO eval baseline × 4 suites + pruning. Expected CV≈0.038 (same linear proj as π0). Checkpoint: lerobot/pi05_libero_finetuned. LeRobot framework adapter needed.\"\n192\t    priority: P0\n193\t    status: planned\n194\t    exp_ids: []\n195\t\n196\t  - plan_id: c3_oft_graded_full\n197\t    claim: C1,C3\n198\t    description: \"OpenVLA-OFT (7B, 3-layer MLP) — 2nd graded-class data point. Baseline × 4 suites + pruning k=0.5/k=0.9 × 4 suites. Same connector as OpenVLA, different action head (OFT). All 4 suite checkpoints on HF (moojink/). Previous Object eval bug needs fixing first.\"\n199\t    priority: P0\n200\t    status: planned\n201\t    exp_ids: []\n202\t\n203\t  - plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n204\t    claim: C5\n205\t    description: \"Perceiver Resampler fine-tune + pruning on LIBERO to validate 3rd connector family\"\n206\t    status: planned\n207\t    exp_ids:\n208\t      - c5-roboflamingo-libero-baseline\n209\