ning to validate VTR across connector types. M=128 20K checkpoint being evaluated.\"\n    status: in_progress\n    exp_ids:\n      - train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42\n      - train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3\n      - train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3\n\n  - plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    claim: C1\n    description: \"D108 COMPLETE (D113): L2≈random at k≤0.7 (Δ<2pp), L2>random at k=0.9 (+8.5pp, 2 seed confirmed). Cross-architecture comparison not confounded by scoring method. CV=0.215 predicts weak gradient exploitable only at margin.\"\n    status: complete\n    exp_ids:\n      - eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_sweep\n\n  - plan_id: c1_xvla_threshold_localization\n    claim: C1\n    description: \"X-VLA k=0.8/k=0.85 3-seed to precisely locate cliff threshold within k=0.7-0.9 interval. Upgrades 'cliff at k=0.7-0.9' to 'sharp transition at k≈0.8X'.\"\n    priority: P1\n    status: in_progress\n    exp_ids:\n      - eval_xvla_prune_k080\n      - eval_xvla_prune_k085\n\n  - plan_id: diagnostic_oft_cv\n    claim: C1\n    description: \"OFT token importance CV measurement. Single forward pass. Expected CV≈0.215 (≈Standard OpenVLA), completing 5/5 model diagnostic table.\"\n    priority: P0\n    status: in_progress\n    exp_ids:\n      - analysis_openvla_oft_cv\n\n  - plan_id: c6_libero_suite_expansion\n    claim: C1,C2,C3\n    description: \"Expand pruning experiments from LIBERO-Object to ALL 4 suites (Spatial, Goal, Long). Baselines + key pruning points (k=0.5, k=0.9) for OpenVLA, X-VLA, SmolVLA on each suite. Validates cross-suite generalization of connector-determined compressibility.\"\n    priority: P0\n    status: in_progress\n    exp_ids: []\n\n  - plan_id: c6_libero_suite_vtr\n    claim: C4\n    description: \"VTR compression validation on LIBERO Spatial/Goal/Long. SmolVLA VTR M=32 on each suite to confirm re-encoding works across task distributions.\"\n    priority: P1\n    status: planned\n    exp_ids: []\n\n  - plan_id: c7_libero_plus_robustness\n    claim: C1,C3\n    description: \"ABANDONED (D119): LIBERO-Plus L1 camera SR=3.3% floor effect — no room for pruning analysis. Finding noted in discussion as VLA brittleness evidence.\"\n    priority: deprioritized\n    status: abandoned\n    exp_ids: []\n\n  - plan_id: c1_pi05_immune_confirmation\n    claim: C1\n    description: \"π0.5 (4B, PaliGemma linear proj) — 2nd immune-class data point. Offline CV/entropy analysis + LIBERO eval baseline × 4 suites + pruning. Expected CV≈0.038 (same linear proj as π0). Checkpoint: lerobot/pi05_libero_finetuned. LeRobot framework adapter needed.\"\n    priority: P0\n    status: planned\n    exp_ids: []\n\n  - plan_id: c3_oft_graded_full\n    claim: C1,C3\n    description: \"OpenVLA-OFT (7B, 3-layer MLP) — 2nd graded-class data point. Baseline × 4 suites + pruning k=0.5/k=0.9 × 4 suites. Same connector as OpenVLA, different action head (OFT). All 4 suite checkpoints on HF (moojink/). Previous Object eval bug needs fixing first.\"\n    priority: P0\n    status: planned\n    exp_ids: []\n\n  - plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    claim: C5\n    description: \"Perceiver Resampler fine-tune + pruning on LIBERO to validate 3rd connector family\"\n    status: planned\n    exp_ids:\n      - c5-roboflamingo-libero-baseline\n","numLines":209,"startLine":1,"totalLines":209}}}
